# The ActionComponent flow channel only creates the heated perimeter (P_hf) variable when a heat
# transfer component is connected, and always outputs the velocity as a scalar ('vel') rather than
# the classic vector (vel_x, vel_y, vel_z); the velocity is rhouA / rhoA, which are compared.
COORDINATES
TIME STEPS
ELEMENT VARIABLES
	A
	H
	T
	e
	p
	rho
	rhoA
	rhoEA
	rhouA
	v
